Brenda invested $300 into a scheme that accumulates simple interest at three-quarters of the original amount per year. How much in total will she have after 3 years?,Brenda invested $300 into a scheme that accumulates simple interest at the rate of three-quarters of the original amount per year. How much in total will she have after 3 years?,975,975,975,975,"Let me solve this step by step.

1) First, let's identify the key information:
