"A local clothing store has a total of 40 white shirts and 50 floral shirts in stock. Half of the white shirts have collars, and 20 of the floral shirts are designed with buttons. How many more floral shirts with no buttons are there than white shirts with no collars?","A clothing store has 40 white shirts and 50 floral shirts. Half of the white shirts have collars, and 20 of the floral shirts have buttons. How many more floral shirts with no buttons are there than white shirts with no collars?",10,10,10,10,"Let me solve this step by step.

