"Argo has 200 toys. He gives 40 to Alyssa, 80 to Bonnie, and 30 to Nicky. How many toys does Argo have now?","Argo has 200 toys. He gives 40 toys to Alyssa, 80 to Bonnie, and 30 to Nicky. How many toys does Argo have now?",50,50,50,50,"Let me solve this step by step:

